                "Nitridal-Linn's NL-HIL fixture has sinter S-2 growling at 48 acoustic pulses/s against a 12 pps hush band. "
                "Induction coil 38 kA remains 14 kA below the 52 kA breaker, so a current-first dispatcher would walk 12 t/h AlN grit. "
                "Lawful action is to pin the screw; the mock ammeter is not a license to chew a noisy die.",